@alippai that was just our bot helping us to categorize issues based on their current state.

the compiler is currently not fully incremental because of some architectural constraints that we are removing in the new renderer we call ivy. we should however investigate if your change really improves the current situation. we'll need @chuckjaz to take a look at your PR as he's the one who needs to approve the change in this piece of code.

sorry about the delay. I'll see if we can have chuck take a quick look next week.
